        {
          "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line010",
          "start": 51,
          "end": 64,
          "surface": "晉隆安初，王恭起兵討王國寶"
        },
        {
          "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line010",
          "start": 147,
          "end": 163,
          "surface": "廞敗走，不知所在。長子泰為恭所殺"
        },
        {
          "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line010",
          "start": 164,
          "end": 173,
          "surface": "華時年十三，在軍中"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
