      ],
      "events": [
        {
          "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line020",
          "start": 52,
          "end": 61,
          "surface": "此弒君亭，不可泊也"
        },
        {
          "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line020",
          "start": 63,
          "end": 77,
          "surface": "華每閑居諷詠，常誦王粲登樓賦"
        },
        {
          "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line020",
          "start": 120,
          "end": 147,
          "surface": "元嘉二年，甯子病卒。三年，誅羨之等，華遷護軍，侍中如故"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
