      "events": [
        {
          "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line024",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 13,
          "surface": "子定侯嗣，官至左衞將軍，卒"
        },
        {
          "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line024",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 37,
          "surface": "子長嗣，太宗泰始二年，坐罵母奪爵，以長弟終紹封"
        },
        {
          "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line024",
          "start": 38,
          "end": 64,
          "surface": "後廢帝元徽三年，終上表乞以封還長，許之。齊受禪，國除"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line026",
