        "quote": "夏四月甲戌，兗州刺史王恭，豫州刺史庾楷舉兵，以討尚書左僕射王國寶、建威將軍王緒爲名。"
      },
      "interpretation": "本紀具月日，第一起兵者王恭、庾楷。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line010",
      "start": 112,
      "end": 117,
      "surface": "廞起兵之際",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFA",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2567072,
        "path": "source-evidence/jin065-wang-descendants/external/jin010-ws2567072.wikitext",
        "sha256": "191bbf44a05c366e9ce2ae1556f05d317245ff0d923e97e99d5aad06c81e8794",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2567072",
        "title": "晉書·安帝紀",
        "line": 22,
        "start": 2,
        "end": 23,
        "quote": "五月，前司徒長史王廞以吳郡反，王恭討平之。"
      },
      "interpretation": "廞以吳郡反另在五月。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line010",
      "start": 179,
      "end": 187,
      "surface": "隨沙門釋曇永逃竄",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2478204,
        "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi023-ws2478204.wikitext",
        "sha256": "c54bdda206986e5d4e5331144e783f163b5823855581b9833572e1982d1d4e40",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2478204",
        "title": "南史·王華傳",
        "line": 51,
        "start": 162,
        "end": 169,
        "quote": "隨沙門釋曇冰逃"
      },
      "interpretation": "同一救華脫津邏場景，僧名冰、永分見。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line010",
      "start": 12,
      "end": 19,
      "surface": "太保弘從祖弟也",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2478204,
        "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi023-ws2478204.wikitext",
        "sha256": "c54bdda206986e5d4e5331144e783f163b5823855581b9833572e1982d1d4e40",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2478204",
        "title": "南史·王華傳",
        "line": 51,
        "start": 6,
        "end": 11,
        "quote": "誕從祖弟也"
      },
      "interpretation": "南史卷內承王誕。兩處稱從祖弟，所相比的人不同。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line010",
      "start": 164,
      "end": 169,
      "surface": "華時年十三",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2478204,
        "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi023-ws2478204.wikitext",
        "sha256": "c54bdda206986e5d4e5331144e783f163b5823855581b9833572e1982d1d4e40",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2478204",
        "title": "南史·王華傳",
        "line": 51,
        "start": 148,
        "end": 156,
        "quote": "華時年十三在軍中"
      },
      "interpretation": "宋數位本明注此數據南史改，並非兩個獨立傳本共同支持十三。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line012",
      "start": 46,
      "end": 51,
      "surface": "乃發廞喪問",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 1756144,
        "path": "sources/jinshu/jin065-ws1756144.wikitext",
        "sha256": "98c7262170dcc4bf0f7e831fb693e46ff819e46fdd9407a484c787185901550a",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1756144",
        "title": "晉書·王廞附傳",
        "line": 114,
        "start": 196,
        "end": 211,
        "quote": "從兄謐言其死所，華始發喪，入仕"
      },
      "interpretation": "晉書說王謐告死所；宋書記劉裕出喪問。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line014",
      "start": 203,
      "end": 208,
      "surface": "華代為司馬",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2478204,
        "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi023-ws2478204.wikitext",
        "sha256": "c54bdda206986e5d4e5331144e783f163b5823855581b9833572e1982d1d4e40",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2478204",
        "title": "南史·王華傳",
        "line": 53,
        "start": 188,
        "end": 198,
        "quote": "邵坐被征，華代為司馬"
      },
      "interpretation": "王華任司馬的位置是本段第二個司馬，前任張邵。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line016",
      "start": 72,
      "end": 77,
      "surface": "且三人勢均",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2478204,
        "path": "sources/nanshi/nanshi023-ws2478204.wikitext",
        "sha256": "c54bdda206986e5d4e5331144e783f163b5823855581b9833572e1982d1d4e40",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2478204",
        "title": "南史·王華傳",
        "line": 55,
        "start": 124,
        "end": 142,
        "quote": "羨之、亮、晦又要檀道濟、王弘五人同功"
      },
      "interpretation": "基本三人為徐羨之、傅亮、謝晦；另邀檀道濟、王弘得五人。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line018",
      "start": 102,
      "end": 106,
      "surface": "師錫僉曰",
      "person_id": "430_f4c_1b9",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 10640694,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws10640694.wikitext",
        "sha256": "8d3ee868e9ac8113d1e6e34c084ef02a00207b8a5c02350ec943f701b6113010",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=10640694",
        "title": "尚書·堯典",
        "line": 59,
        "start": 0,
        "end": 2,
        "quote": "師錫"
      },
      "interpretation": "「師錫」在薦舜語境。下句「僉曰」另見舉鯀等事，非一處逐字連文。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line018",
      "start": 102,
      "end": 106,
      "surface": "師錫僉曰",
      "person_id": "430_f4c_1b9",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 10640694,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws10640694.wikitext",
        "sha256": "8d3ee868e9ac8113d1e6e34c084ef02a00207b8a5c02350ec943f701b6113010",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=10640694",
        "title": "尚書·堯典",
        "line": 43,
        "start": 0,
        "end": 25,
        "quote": "僉曰：「於，{{ProperNoun|鯀}}哉！」"
      },
      "interpretation": "此處僉曰議用鯀；與薦舜別事。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line018",
      "start": 114,
      "end": 125,
      "surface": "拔茅征吉，著於幽賁之爻",
      "person_id": "430_f4c_1b9",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2106138,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws2106138.wikitext",
        "sha256": "ecd49dba63369af09ab717293badc4b5823106b89c25ee5ebed44466817616e7",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2106138",
        "title": "周易·泰",
        "line": 13,
        "start": 27,
        "end": 40,
        "quote": "初九：拔茅茹以其彙，征吉。"
      },
      "interpretation": "泰初九有此爻辭，孔奏自用「幽賁」一語。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line018",
      "start": 114,
      "end": 118,
      "surface": "拔茅征吉",
      "person_id": "430_f4c_1b9",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2106138,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws2106138.wikitext",
        "sha256": "ecd49dba63369af09ab717293badc4b5823106b89c25ee5ebed44466817616e7",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2106138",
        "title": "周易·泰·象",
        "line": 25,
        "start": 2,
        "end": 11,
        "quote": "拔茅征吉，志在外也"
      },
      "interpretation": "象辭連書四字與奏合。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line018",
      "start": 131,
      "end": 135,
      "surface": "瓜衍作賞",
      "person_id": "430_f4c_1b9",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2676002,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws2676002.wikitext",
        "sha256": "de9f3ee9cf701cc16568023604afead4bbf37ca3aebfe9cad98f037050711bef",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2676002",
        "title": "左傳·宣公十五年",
        "line": 317,
        "start": 0,
        "end": 19,
        "quote": "晉侯賞桓子狄臣千室，亦賞士伯以瓜衍之縣"
      },
      "interpretation": "瓜衍為士伯所受，桓子受狄臣；兩種賞區分。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line018",
      "start": 141,
      "end": 145,
      "surface": "蒍賈不賀",
      "person_id": "430_f4c_1b9",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 12913623,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws12913623.wikitext",
        "sha256": "cbdb8d9ddb309796735d47090fba56aabf637a5d9779481925267cc62967bd40",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=12913623",
        "title": "左傳·僖公二十七年",
        "line": 913,
        "start": 46,
        "end": 70,
        "quote": "國老皆賀子文，子文飲之酒。蒍賈尚幼，後至，不賀。"
      },
      "interpretation": "蒍賈以子文薦子玉而可能敗國為憂；非孔甯子時同僚。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line018",
      "start": 157,
      "end": 161,
      "surface": "韶之盡美",
      "person_id": "430_f4c_1b9",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2200702,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws2200702.wikitext",
        "sha256": "f44caba9b18595c34811f9cc71ae852dc8b9c0702d6c59210ebe0cf943ab26d9",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2200702",
        "title": "論語·八佾",
        "line": 80,
        "start": 0,
        "end": 29,
        "quote": "子謂韶：「盡美矣，又盡善也。」謂武：「盡美矣，未盡善也。」"
      },
      "interpretation": "韶、武是兩部樂舞，就美善之別論。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line018",
      "start": 260,
      "end": 264,
      "surface": "舉爾所知",
      "person_id": "430_f4c_1b9",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 11118102,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws11118102.wikitext",
        "sha256": "eedef73b675f807f0de0a7e93e019d6c5fe5891b024fcdf831ec758f12c94292",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=11118102",
        "title": "論語·子路",
        "line": 10,
        "start": 42,
        "end": 57,
        "quote": "擧爾所知。爾所不知，人其舍諸？"
      },
      "interpretation": "原章仲弓問政，孔子答舉才；此為引古。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line018",
      "start": 346,
      "end": 350,
      "surface": "治阿之宰",
      "person_id": "430_f4c_1b9",
      "reading_status": "probable_allusion",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 365724,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws365724.wikitext",
        "sha256": "0441ba392eb33f2ef969cf87ada9b26a0b928b64d1dce28f98d7a2a78b53f9bc",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=365724",
        "title": "意林卷三引新序",
        "line": 125,
        "start": 0,
        "end": 12,
        "quote": "子奇年十六，齊君使治阿。"
      },
      "interpretation": "同地、少而能治與不必計年相合。奏中未出子奇名，十六僅繫古例。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line018",
      "start": 356,
      "end": 360,
      "surface": "免徒之守",
      "person_id": "430_f4c_1b9",
      "reading_status": "unresolved_analogy",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 1753957,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws1753957.wikitext",
        "sha256": "35ad92f47b36d24496f6e92d7882b676371cf9b4b02a6e11d293fd5a7e7b9f27",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1753957",
        "title": "史記·馮唐列傳",
        "line": 36,
        "start": 489,
        "end": 504,
        "quote": "令馮唐持節赦魏尚，復以爲雲中守"
      },
      "interpretation": "魏尚曾因上功失實罰作、得赦復守，事類相合；無明文指為奏中此人。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line018",
      "start": 356,
      "end": 360,
      "surface": "免徒之守",
      "person_id": "430_f4c_1b9",
      "reading_status": "unresolved_analogy",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2101579,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws2101579.wikitext",
        "sha256": "893ee544f4ae0e42be7fdbb7c390af9b218545e11b992705d9a02789bae476ef",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2101579",
        "title": "漢書·馮唐傳",
        "line": 33,
        "start": 463,
        "end": 477,
        "quote": "令唐持節赦魏尚，復以為雲中守"
      },
      "interpretation": "亦見馮唐持節，非獨立證明孔奏所指。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line018",
      "start": 466,
      "end": 470,
      "surface": "仁必由己",
      "person_id": "430_f4c_1b9",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 12969984,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws12969984.wikitext",
        "sha256": "76a2f61d683add03fa7570f4dfb3e3693161b60948a49a6988d1a5f7ef5b1cb5",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=12969984",
        "title": "論語·顏淵",
        "line": 8,
        "start": 31,
        "end": 42,
        "quote": "爲仁由己，而由人乎哉？"
      },
      "interpretation": "顏淵問仁；甯子奏改述其意。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line020",
      "start": 53,
      "end": 56,
      "surface": "弒君亭",
      "person_id": "0ab_f5d_337",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2309989,
        "path": "source-evidence/jin079-shang-xuan/external/song004-ws2309989.wikitext",
        "sha256": "eab64e161b5a543f80ed64a451836038f4a3492fe368737309b8c402661c5db5",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2309989",
        "title": "宋書·少帝紀",
        "line": 48,
        "start": 220,
        "end": 233,
        "quote": "中書舍人邢安泰弒帝於金昌亭"
      },
      "interpretation": "本紀直敘劉義符遇害；孔甯子拒泊其亭。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line020",
      "start": 80,
      "end": 93,
      "surface": "冀王道之一平，假高衢而騁力",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 1968766,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws1968766.wikitext",
        "sha256": "5a669a1dcf2bcc15e75dd26d0da7b031e15ed6452e37e662761a5b4f476db362",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1968766",
        "title": "王粲·登樓賦",
        "line": 32,
        "start": 0,
        "end": 15,
        "quote": "冀王道之一平兮，假高衢而騁力。"
      },
      "interpretation": "賦本文有兮；宋書敘王華所誦無兮。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line020",
      "start": 130,
      "end": 137,
      "surface": "三年，誅羨之等",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2370105,
        "path": "sources/songshu/song005-ws2370105.wikitext",
        "sha256": "a8c2b67f4b5da1596c81b26e1c1bda24b8881d6f9508c2de613fb5f2453a5cca",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2370105",
        "title": "宋書·文帝紀",
        "line": 32,
        "start": 33,
        "end": 45,
        "quote": "左光祿大夫傅亮，有罪伏誅"
      },
      "interpretation": "本紀以有罪伏誅括徐、傅，另遣將討謝晦。"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-063-wanghua-tanshou:line020",
      "start": 130,
      "end": 137,
      "surface": "三年，誅羨之等",
      "person_id": "7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB",
      "reading_status": "parallel_attestation",
      "parallel": {
        "revision_id": 2256870,
        "path": "source-evidence/song063-wanghua/external/ws2256870.wikitext",
        "sha256": "543b4956eecbae49e1e5a8a29e96abec2e8bd232d17a148723cbb8775695b377",
        "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2256870",
        "title": "宋書·徐羨之傳",
        "line": 33,
        "start": 71,
        "end": 84,
        "quote": "步走至新林，入陶竈中自剄死"
      },
      "interpretation": "本傳敘徐羨之自剄，王華、到彥之受命追討。"
    },
